1 NOTE !Temple Ordinance Book of John Robert Tree.
1 NOTE  Temple Ordinance Book of John Robert Tree.
2 CONT Shoemaker is listed as occupation in 1851 Census of Bearsted, Kent, England.  John R. and his wife, Mary A. were living with Edward Tree, father, in 1851 Census.  Address was "Roce or Rose Acre".
2 CONT
2 CONT Second baptism date:  Oct 1864 and end.  28 Feb 1876 EHOUS
2 CONT Robert John in christening record.
2 CONT 1880 Address:  Centerville, Davis, Utah
2 CONT In 1880 Census of United States, John R. Tree was married, male, white, 56 and born in England.  He was a shoe maker.  His father and mother were both born in England.
2 CONT Mary A. Tree was his wife, female 55, born in England, keeping house.  Her parents were both born in England.  No children were in their home at that time.
