2 CONT Brief Life History of Edward'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Edward King was christened on 24 November 1583, in Biddenden, Kent, England, his father, Philip King, was 44 and his mother, Joane Kinge, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Mary Carpenter on 9 June 1606, in East Malling, Kent, England. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 1 daughter. 
2 CONT Clemente King b. 1606
2 CONT John King b. 1609
2 CONT William Kinge b. 1614
2 CONT Elizabeth Kinge b. 1616
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried in East Malling, Kent, England.
