1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Samuel Hayes was the son of Henry Hayes (b.1801, d.1881); and Mary Smithers (b.1809, d.1874) and the grandson of the miller of flour George Roche Hayes of Clonakitty, Co. Cork, Ireland. He married Susan Cook o
2 CONC n May 16, 1856 in Port Macquarie, NSW, Australia. They named their children born between 1855 to 1873: John, Frederick Henry, Richard, Mary A., Isabella, Alfred, Thomas, Douglas, Edward, Sydney Blacksland and Susan Emily Frances H
2 CONC ayes.His wife Susan was the daughter of William Cook (b.1802, d.?) and Harriet Hubbard (b.1802, d.?); They were married during 1821 in Sydney, NSW
