1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=124854591-13-5587&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-b3f969d5627c2d94bd7cd919c2128f0b&mrid=86bf5443b51d01d060aa9
