1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mabel Melita CONWAY. Born 13th May 1886 to Matilda nee McCleester and John Conway, Lieutenant, Quartermaster, 1st Battalion, Duke of Cornwall’s Light Infantry. Died accidentally in tragic circumstances in Malta 14t
2 CONC h December 1886.  https://www.militaryimages.net/media/conway-matilda-2.135428/full6.
2 CONT
2 CONT Matilda Evelin Conway
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT 24 JAN 1890 - Bellary, Tamil Nadu, India
2 CONT Death
2 CONT Dec 1963 - Folkestone, Kent, England
