2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Bellary, Tamil Nadu, India on 24 JAN 1890 to John Conway and Matilda McCleester. Matilda Evelin Conway married Edward James Cheeseman and had 5 children. She passed away on Dec 1963 in Folkestone, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT john Conway I am looking to make the connection to John Conway's parents and siblings in Ireland. Is there anyone out there who can help please ? Born 10.10.1845 Protestant, Killaloe, Clare, Ireland. Died 06.09.1923 Jhellum, Kashm
2 CONC ir, India. Married Matilda McCleester and had six children Catherine, Albert,James, Walter,Clement and Matilda born variously in England, India and South Africa. John Conway left home to join the 32nd Ft.Duke of Cornwall's Light I
2 CONC nfantry eventually rising through the ranks to become Hon.Capt.Quarter Master of Regiment. Eventually retired in India not having ever returned to his birthplace. I am stuck, so any help would be very much appreciated ? tHIS BY PA
2 CONC TRICK cONWAY 17 nOV. 2006
2 CONT https://www.genesreunited.co.za/boards/board/ancestors/thread/385049
