2 CONT As a mother of twins it is easy for me to paint a picture of these two little ones in their cots, perhaps sleeping or playing happily as my twins so often did. In the case of most twins there is a special bond, a closeness, perhap
2 CONC s due to the fact they shared the womb. They came into this world together, and they departed this life together, harsh as this may be it is reality, and it is up to us to celebrate the short time they passed this way. 
