2 CONT
2 CONT Kennedy Murray was born circa 21 August 1771 at Dundonald, Ayrshire, Scotland.  John Murray - Elizabeth Calder were servants to the Countess of Eglingtoune. Kennedy was baptized at Dundonald on the 24th August 1771.  Lady Eglinton
2 CONC  was the daughter of Sir Archibald Kennedy. This might explain his first name.
