1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Richard Reed (Read/Reid) was sentenced to seven years transportation on a charge of assault. He arrived in Van Diemen's Land (now Tasmania) in 1837 aboard the Susan.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Olivia Lucas in Evandale Tasmania, had sons Henry, Richard and James and daughters Eliza and Mary. Henry and Richard both killed in mining falls in Victoria, both their widows remarried. Eliza married James Baker in Ballar
2 CONC at Victoria. Richard died in Carngham Vic. Mary died at an unknown time. Olivia died in Evandale.
