1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary BROOKER was born 28/11/1812 Windsor (daughter of Jonathan BROOKER and Mary WADE)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was baptised on 13/4/1819 at Liverpool
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married John HART on 14/2/1829 Wollongong, NSW, Australia
2 CONT
2 CONT After John's death in 1830, Mary married Christopher LEDWIDGE on 16/4/1833 (alternate date 17/11/1833)  at Wollongong, NSW and they had the following children
2 CONT * John Christopher 26/7/1832
2 CONT * Christopher 5/5/1834
2 CONT
2 CONT After Christopher's death on 5/2/1834, Mary married Henry ANGEL on 3/9/1834 at Wollongong, NSW and they had the following children
2 CONT * Henry 16/11/1836
2 CONT * William 17/11/1838
2 CONT * Robert 5/10/1841 * Twin
2 CONT * Keturah 5/10/1841 * Twin
2 CONT * Richard 19/2/1844
2 CONT * Mary 10/2/1847  * Twin
2 CONT * Sarah M 10/2/1847  * Twin
2 CONT * James 8/3/1850
2 CONT * Edward Jonathan 13/6/1852
2 CONT * Samuel 18/12/1853
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary died 29/9/1890 at Lake Albert, NSW and was buried at Wagga Wagga, NSW
2 CONT
