1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From the Monaro Pioneers Web Site
2 CONT
2 CONT Maurice married Sarah Jane Murray, daughter of William Murray and Mary Ann, on November 18, 1896 in Sydney, NSW. Sarah was born in 1871 in Goulburn, NSW and died on July 17, 1942 in Picton, NSW at age 71. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT  M i. Leslie Alphonsus Tyson Sheil was born on July 15, 1898 in Picton, NSW and died on December 19, 1969 in Burwood, NSW at age 71. Leslie married Gerturde Veronica Rutledge, daughter of John E. Rutledge and Bridget Hannon, on No
2 CONC vember 12, 1924 in Picton, NSW. Gerturde was born in 1903 in St Peters, NSW and died on December 31, 1926 in Paddington, NSW at age 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Leslie next married Eileen Christina Rutledge, daughter of John E. Rutledge and Bridget Hannon, on September 6, 1927 in Sydney, NSW. Eileen was born on August 13, 1906 in Newtown, NSW and died on July 19, 1980 at age 73. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  M ii. Maurice Augustine Sheil was born  on February 2, 1900  in Picton, NSW7 and died  on January 18, 1979  at age 78. He never married and had no children. 
2 CONT  M iii. Francis Murray Sheil was born on November 25, 1903 in Picton, NSW and died on January 30, 1991 in Douglas Park, NSW at age 87. Francis married Mary Isabelle McInnes, daughter of Hector McInnes and Elizabeth A. Walton, on M
2 CONC arch 1, 1930 in Picton, NSW. Mary was born on June 29, 1899 in Picton, NSW and died on December 22, 1989 in Picton, NSW at age 90. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  M iv. Dominic William Sheil was born on March 30, 1906 in Picton, NSW and died on March 4, 1993 in Douglas Park, NSW at age 86. Dominic married Lorna Lenore Rice on November 9, 1935 in Picton, NSW.755 Lorna was born on October 27
2 CONC , 1914. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  F v. Mary Anne Sheil was born on February 11, 1909 in Picton, NSW and died on August 9, 1994 in Young, NSW at age 85. Mary married Leo Joseph Goonan in 1940 in Randwick, NSW. Leo was born on April 16, 1916 and died on March 23, 1
2 CONC 985 at age 68. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  M vi. William George Sheil was born on May 28, 1911 in Picton, NSW and died on August 12, 1974 in Picton, NSW at age 63. William married Adelaide Frances Blades on February 15, 1936 in Picton, NSW.758 Adelaide was born on August 
2 CONC 10, 1909 in Douglas Park, NSW and died on February 20, 1990 at age 80. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  F vii. Catherine Imelda Sheil was born on September 16, 1914 in Picton, NSW and died on October 27, 1990 at age 76. Catherine married Edward Francis Cummins, son of Robert Cummins and Florence, on May 22, 1942 in Picton, NSW. Edw
2 CONC ard was born on December 6, 1914 and died on July 17, 1973 in Sutherland, NSW at age 58. 
