2 CONT '''Lithgow Mercury (NSW : 1898 - 1954)   Mon 30 Oct 1922  Page 3  BELL AND MT. WILSON.'''
2 CONT The death occurred on Wednesday of Mr. S. Kirk, senr., at his residence, Mt.Wilson. The deceased was an old identity and greatly respected in the locality. He has left a widow and large family. The funeral took place at Mt. Wilson
2 CONC  in the presence of a large number of relatives and friends of deceased. Rev. Heffernan performed the burial service. Sympathy is extended to the widow and family in their bereavement.
