2 CONT '''Lithgow Mercury (NSW : 1898 - 1954)   Fri 8 Jul 1938  Page 4  MR. LESLIE KIRK'''
2 CONT MR. LESLIE KIRK
2 CONT DEATH OF JELLEINDORE
2 CONT RESIDENT
2 CONT (From Our Own Correspondent)
2 CONT The death occurred at his residence,Jelleindore at 10 a.m. on Wednesday morning of Mr. Leslie Kirk at the age of 70 years. The deceased was the -third son of the late Mr. and Mrs. R. Kirk, and had lived for 60 years in the distric
2 CONC t, where he successfully carried on farming and grazing. He was an excellent neighbor, and his kindness and charity was well known.He married Miss Sarah Dwyer, of this centre, who survives him. He also leaves two daughters - Vera 
2 CONC (Mrs.Ashby, of Fairfield) and Sylvia (Mrs.F. Pye), also an only son and daughter-in-law, Mr. and Mrs. Bert Kirk, of Jelleindore; to all of whom sincere sympathy is extended.
