1 NOTE !BIRTH YEAR AND PLACE OF RESIDENCE FROM MARRIAGE CERTIFICATE, A COPY IN
2 CONT POSSESSION OF ANNE CLARK, SUBMITTER.  FATHER'S NAME, JOHN GATTON (DEAD IN 1888)
2 CONT BOTH JAMES AND JOHN GATTON WERE BOOT MAKERS.
1 NOTE 542651  1861 Census Maidstone, Kent   pg. 40   #30  This census shows James as age 11 (close) and born in Wonersh, Surrey, England.  Wonersh is very close to the larger city Guildford, where James says he is born. He would be born
2 CONC  in 1850 then.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth year and place of residence from marriage certificate a copy in possession of Anne Clark.  Father's name, John Gatton (dead in 1888) both James and John Gatton were boot makers.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1881 British Census lists James Gatton living with widowed mother, Hannah Gatton, age 71 years.  James is 27 years old, and listed as a "boot maker."  Sounds like the boot fits :)  Address:  68 Stone St., Maidstone, Kent, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Date for death is from the Birth Marr/Death Register.  1898. Death certificate in Anne's possession says that he died at 45 years.  He was a bootmaker master.  He had pletheses Pulmonalis.  C. Farley was present at the death  and 
2 CONC Farley's address is 38 Mote Road, Maidstone.  James died the 20th of September 1898 at 51 King Street.  Maidstone, Sub-district East Maidstone, Kent.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fern Hess researched this:  I don't know if this is my James--I thought he was born in 1854 according to the 1881 census.  If this is mine, add the family to my PAF
2 CONT 542651  1861 Census Maidstone, Kent   pg. 40   #30
2 CONT there is a James Gatton age 11--son of John (46) and Hannah ( 50)
2 CONT John is a journey man shoemaker...then there is a place Rudgwick, Sussex [I don't get this part.] Maybe John was born in Rudgwick, which is not too far from Wonersh etc.]
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT Jane   14  shoebuilder      Cranbrook, Kent born
2 CONT Charles  15  shoemaker assistant  Cranbrook, Kent  born
2 CONT Mary 13                                     Surrey, Wonersh born
2 CONT James 11                                  Surrey, Wonersh born
2 CONT ? Eliza 8                                        Maidstone, Kent
