1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MARY T. WALKER, LYMAN, Wyoming--A native of Huntsville, Utah, Mrs. Mary Thurston Walker, 73, died at her Lyman, Wyoming, home Friday after a long illness.  She was born September 19, 1879, at Huntsville, a daughter
2 CONC  of James E. and Regatta Neilson Thurston. She married John Colvin Walker in the Salt Lake City Temple on September 6, 1899. Among survivors is a daughter, Mrs. Arthur Grow, Ogden, Utah.  The funeral was held today at Lyman.  Buri
2 CONC al also was in Lyman.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Ogden Standard Examiner, October 27, 1952, Page 13.  SOURCE:  Find A Grave.com
