1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Liddie Pauline Eyre passed away on Sunday, April 6, 2014, in Evanston, Wyoming.  She was born May 24, 1913,  in Lyman, Wyoming, to Henry John and Melissa Jane Stewart Bluemel.  She was raised in Bridger Valley, Wyo
2 CONC ming, of pioneer stock, the 10th of 12 children and the last of her family to pass away.  She married Preston Eugene Eyre July 18, 1933, in Morgan, Utah and was later sealed in the Logan Temple in 1957.  Liddie worked for J. C. Pe
2 CONC nney for 22 years, being named "Clerk of the Year" several times.  She is survived by daughter Shauna Jean (George) Brimhall of Evanston, Wyoming, and her son Preston LaMar (Sharron) Eyre of Lehi, Utah.  Also eleven grandchildren,
2 CONC  38 great grandchildren and 4 great great grandchildren.  She was preceded in death by her husband Preston Eugene Eyre in 1974 and her parents, a great granddaughter Charly Jean Rasmussen and all 11 siblings.
2 CONT
2 CONT Crandall of Evanston April 8, 2014
