1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Obituary: https://www.legacy.com/ca/obituaries/theglobeandmail/name/charles-norman-obituary?id=41543600
2 CONT NORMAN, Charles
2 CONT Peacefully at Extendicare-Brampton on October 18, 2010 in his 93rd year. Devoted husband of Marion (predeceased 1993) Loving father to Eva (Bob Wilkie), Ed (Annetta), Heather (Graeme Locke), Jeff (Michelle Peacock), and Laurie. De
2 CONC lighted grandfather to Tina, Jennifer, Kathleen, Kathryn, Rebecca, Emily, Matthew, Simon, Max, Zoë, Jacob, Milan and Thomas. Tickled great-grandfather to Zoe, Zachary and Morgaine. Survived by his siblings Muriel (Cameron Leask), 
2 CONC Eva (Ken Mills) and John (Eileen). Dedicated Akela to hundreds of Cubs, and most recently a leader with Second Bramalea Scout Group. He will be fondly remembered by family, friends and community. As per Charlie's wishes cremation 
2 CONC has taken place. A Memorial Service to be held on Saturday October 30, 2010 at 3:00 p.m. at North Bramalea United Church (363 Howden Blvd., Brampton) In lieu of flowers, donations may be made to Scouts Canada. Funeral arrangements
2 CONC  entrusted to Andrews Community Funeral Centre, (905)-456-8190.
2 CONT Tributes may be forwarded to the family at www.andrewscommunityfuneralcentre.com
2 CONT Published by The Globe and Mail on Oct. 27, 2010
