1 NOTE {geni:about_me} PURVEY.— On January 15. at her residence Sturt street, Victor Harbor, Jane (Tot). dearly loved wife of the late Charles H. Purvey and loving mother of Lyla (Mrs G Harvey), Daisy (Mrs J Wemyss) and Ercel (Pat) AIF r
2 CONC eturned aged 64 years
2 CONT
2 CONT LATE MRS. JANE PURVEY.
2 CONT
2 CONT The death occurred on 16th January at her residence, Sturt Street, Victor Harbour, of Mrs. Jane Purvey, at the age of 64 years. The deceased, who was a daughter of the late Mr. and Mrs. Daniel Tugwell, was born at Victor Harbour, 
2 CONC and had lived in the district all her life. Her husband pre-deceased her some years ago, and she is survived by a family of two daugh-ters and one son, viz., Lyla (Mrs. G. Harvey), Daisy (Mrs. J. Wemyss), and Ercel (Pat), A.I.F. r
2 CONC et. The funeral took place at the local cemetery on Thursday of last week.
