2 CONT  (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:XK45-Y3J : 4 December 2014), 
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT I have a record of death from Maitland Cemetery dated 26 April 1959 when he was aged 50. Willie lived in Observatory, Cape Town. He died in Groote Schuur Hospital and was buried in a Grave at Maitland Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Willie's Wife, Maria Magdalena Botes (Le Roux) died on 18 May 1990, aged 78 and shares a grave with Willie at Maitland Cemetery. At the time of death, Maria was living at 9 Burchell Street, Ruyterwacht, Cape Town.
2 CONT
