1 NOTE {geni:about_me} James McCleester/Margaret Ann Mooney b1826
2 CONT My 2 x great grandparents were married in the Ballynafie/Ahoghill area in about 1843 & their first child Nancy Ann McCleester was born in Ahoghill on 22 Oct 1844. If anyone can help me find the marriage record, or provide any info
2 CONC rmation on these families during this period, I would be most grateful
