1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Denne was born about 1497 in Denne Hill, Kingston, Kent and died about 1563 in Denne Hill, Kingston, Kent aged about 66. Thomas married Alicia METT  about 1538 in Stourmouth, Kent. Alicia was born about 1510
2 CONC  in Stourmouth, Kent. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Denne - Kent Visitation page 100'''
2 CONT
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000197329826915&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Source: partial, modified copy of image of page 100 of Kent Visitation''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Citations'':
2 CONT *The visitation of Kent: taken in the years 1619-1621 by John Philipot, Rouge Dragon, Marshal and Deputy to William Camden, Clarenceux by Camden, William, 1551-1623; Philipot, John, 1589?-1645; Hovenden, Robert, 1830-1908; Harleia
2 CONC n Society Published 1898, Denne entry Pg 99. https://archive.org/details/visitationofkent00camd
2 CONT
2 CONT *A Genealogical & Heraldic History of the Landed Gentry, John Burke, 1838, Vol 3, Pg 19.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Links'':
2 CONT * http://www.airgale.com.au/denne/d15.htm#c22363
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Denne-179
