1 NAME Agnes /Denne/
2 GIVN Agnes
2 SURN Denne
2 _MARNM Lade
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1550
2 PLAC Denne Hill, Kingston, Kent, England
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 23 SEP 1625
2 ADDR
3 CITY Barham
3 STAE England
3 CTRY United Kingdom
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Philpot's 1619 Visitation of Kent records Agnes, daughter of Thomas Denne of Denne Hill as the wife of Vincent Lade of Barham.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Lade entry in the same publication records Vincent's wife as Anne, daughter of Thomas Denne of Denne Hill. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Later Lade genealogies record her as Elizabeth, daughter of Vincent Denne, presumably the Elizabeth b.1566 (dau of Vincent Denne & Joanna Kitall) - who married Vincent Nethersole and therefore an error.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Links'':
2 CONT *http://www.airgale.com.au/denne/d17.htm#i22373
