1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LZJC-FXB
2 CONT Brief Life History of Percival'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Percival Kynge was born in 1483, in Ayrshire, Scotland, United Kingdom, his father, Philip Pidrorius Kyng, was 42 and his mother, Mrs Kyng, was 29.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Mrs. Percival Kynge in 1532, in Biddenden, Kent, England. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT Elysabeth b. 1532
2 CONT Johannes (John) b. 1532
2 CONT Persyfale b. 1535
2 CONT William b. 1535
2 CONT Henry b. 1536
2 CONT Robert b. 1536
2 CONT Phillipe (Philip) b. 1540
2 CONT Miriat b. 1542
2 CONT Phillip 2 b. 1557
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1564, in Maidstone, Kent, England, at the age of 81.
