1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/9XR6-4GD
2 CONT Brief Life History of Samuel'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Samuel Daniel was born in September 1739, in Waltham, Kent, England, his father, Samuel Daniels, was 42 and his mother, Mary Birch, was 37. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Margaret Ladd on 3 November 1760, in Waltham, Kent, England, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 1 son. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 23 July 1781, in his hometown, at the age of 41, and was buried in Waltham, Kent, England, United Kingdom.
