2 CONT
2 CONT A copy of Jeremiah's will can be found at franklincurtis.com  Look under family history; the very last sentence on bottom of page has Deceased 29 May 1810; He signed his will on 12 Nov 1807 with his mark an X  Please see Jeremiah 
