2 CONT
2 CONT '''Will Details''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT No real estate. Jeremiah left his personal property to his grandson Enos, son of Edmund Curtis. His wife's apparel to his daughters Jemima Buell, Lydia Ford and Ruth Curtis. Dr. Willoughby of Newport, NY executor.
