1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Richard LUCAS''' was born on January 2, 1833 in Launceston, Tasmania. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34837927 Thomas LUCAS] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34625937516 Margaret SYDES]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789755280 Harriet PRESTAGE] on 8 November 1853 at St Andrew's Church, Geelong, Victoria, Australia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1855 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34719284488 Arthur Stephen ]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34719285279 Mary Elizabeth THOMPSON]
2 CONT * 1857 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34825396824 Frank Prestage Adam William ]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34825433393 Jane Annie Margaret GIBBS]
2 CONT * 1860 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789755418 Blanch Louise ]; married [https://www.geni.com/people/Moses-Sullivan/6000000220742619836 Moses SULLIVAN]
2 CONT * 1863 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789755367 Alfred George ]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789756800 Emily WiSEMAN]
2 CONT * 1865 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789755434 Charles Thomas ]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789757489 Margaret McGARVIE]
2 CONT * 1866 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789755392 William Horace ]. married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789757722 Ann SCOULLER]
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife Harriet died 11 September 1868 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard married [https://www.geni.com/profile-124693075 Catherine BRASSELL] on 26 March 1872 at St Andrews Church, Geelong, Victoria, Australia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1872 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34847169399 Rose Edith] married [https://www.geni.com/people/Samuel-Vaughan/6000000220742034833 Samuel Joseph VAUGHAN]
2 CONT * 1874 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789755319 Ernest Richard]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789757922 Catherine Allen HANLON]
2 CONT * 1877 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789755326 Maude Elizabeth]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789758161 Alexander McKENZIE]
2 CONT * 1878 twins [https://www.geni.com/profile-34789755307 Henry Albert]; died young
2 CONT * 1878 twins [https://www.geni.com/profile-124691864 Herbert Leslie ]; married [https://www.geni.com/profile-124691870 Elizabeth] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-31954191 Margaret Lillian DUNFORD]
2 CONT * 1880 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34785624089 Minnie May] married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34785624012 William Charles DUFF]
2 CONT * 1882 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34847169404 Elsie Ella] married [https://www.geni.com/people/James-Rankin/6000000220741809861 James Alexander RANKIN]
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard died on January 14, 1883 in Camperdown, VIC, Australia and was buried in Camperdown Cemetery.  His wife Catherine died 31 October 1915
2 CONT
2 CONT =CAUTION=
2 CONT Some internet trees have confused the children of Richard with the children of [https://www.geni.com/people/Walter-Lucas/6000000021627999129 Walter Charles LUCAS] from Tasmania.
2 CONT
2 CONT =SOURCES (see media, timeline and sources tab)=
2 CONT * Victoria Marriage Record - Richard LUCAS married Harriet PRESTAGE in 1853
2 CONT * Victoria Birth Record - Blanch Louise LUCAS born 1860 Ashb, father Richard, mother Harriet PRESTAGE
2 CONT * Victoria Birth Record - Alfred George LUCAS born 1863 Marr, father Richard, mother Harriet PRESTAGE
2 CONT * Victoria Birth Record - Charles Thomas LUCAS born 1865 Camp, father Richard, mother Harriet DRUMMOND
2 CONT * Victoria Birth Record - William Horace LUCAS born 1866 Camperdown, father Richard, mother Harriot PRESTAGE
2 CONT * Victoria Marriage Record - Richard LUCAS married Cate BRASSEL on 26 March1872 at Geelong
2 CONT * Victoria Birth Record - Ernest Richard LUCAS born 1874 C'Down, father Richard, mother Kate BRAZELL
2 CONT * Victoria Baptism Record - Ernest LUCAS born 14 October 1874 baptised 29 December 1875  St Marys, Geelong, father Richard LUCAS, mother Catherine BROTHER
2 CONT * Victoria Baptism Record - Rose Ann LUCAS born 2 December 1872 baptised 29 December 1875 St Marys, Geelong, father Richard LUCAS, mother Catherine BROTHER
2 CONT * Victoria Birth Record - Maude Elizabeth LUCAS born 1877 C'Down, father Richard, mother Catherine BRAZZELL
2 CONT * Victoria Baptism Record - Maud Elizabeth LUCAS born 20 October 1876 baptised 6 November 1877 St Marys Geelong, father Richard LUCAS, mother Kate BRAZZEN
2 CONT * Victoria Birth Record - Herbert Leslie LUCAS born 1878 Camp, father Richard, mother Catherine BRAZILL
2 CONT * Victoria Birth Record - Henry Albert LUCAS born 1878 Camp, father Richard, mother Catherine BRAZILL
2 CONT * gravestone
2 CONT * Victoria Death Record - Richard LUCAS died 1883 Campberdown, age 50, father Thomas LUCAS, mother Margaret SYDES
2 CONT * Victoria Probate Record - Richard LUCAS died 14 January 1883, Probate 6 March 1883, Grazier
2 CONT * Newspaper reports
2 CONT
