1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/K8M4-BNS/amy-annie-reed-1884
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Reed-33189
2 CONT Amy Annie (Reed) Besch
2 CONT Born 6 Apr 1884 in Honeywood, Tasmania, Australia 
2 CONT Died 7 Dec 1960 at age 76 in Dalby, Queensland, Australia
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT Birth records have her name as Amy Annie Reed, parents were Richard Reed and Bridget Catherine Reed (nee Howard). He was a labourer and they lived on Richard Road, Honeywood.
2 CONT
2 CONT She had eight siblings. Some family trees have her father's surname as Reid.
2 CONT
2 CONT Online marriage records have her surname as Reid.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her children's birth records have her maiden name as Reed.
2 CONT
2 CONT By 1921 she was living in Baruthwaite, Bajool, Queensland under the name Annie Besch. No one else on the Roll has Baruthwaite as part of their address.
2 CONT
2 CONT Did she come back to Western Australia to have her daughter and then left her husband and took her daughter Ellen back with her to Queensland?
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1925 she was still on the electoral roll with her husband at James Street Bassendean.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1926 and 1930 she was still in Baruthwaite, Bajool.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the 1936 electoral roll her name is recorded as Annie Burnthwaite Besch and living in South Ulam.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1936 in her mother's death notice she was still living in Queensland under the surname Besch.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the 1943 and 1949 electoral rolls she was still in South Ulam under the name Annie Burnthwaite Besch.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1954 she was still there and there was also a Ian Alastair Besch living at Burnthwaite, Bajool. He was mechanic bur doed not appear to be related.
2 CONT
2 CONT Another source has her dying in 1954 in Ipswich.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT Tasmania BDM records. Birth reg 786/1884. https://librariestas.ent.sirsidynix.net.au/client/en_AU/names/search/results?qu=annie&qu=reed&qf=NI_INDEX%09Record+type%09Births%09Births
2 CONT Victoria BDM records. Marriage reg 8416/1902.
2 CONT Australian Electoral Rolls. 1903 - 1980.
2 CONT Children's Birth registrations.
2 CONT
2 CONT Qld BDM Marriage Registration 
2 CONT Amy Annie Reed
2 CONT Event date: 27/11/1930
2 CONT Event type: Marriage registration
2 CONT Registration details: 1930/C/3328Spouse: Alexander Langford Fisher
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/185526810/amy_ann-fisher
