1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Robert John SPINKS''' was born on January 6, 1823 in New South Wales, Australia. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-110950718 John SPINKS] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34622592430 Ann CARNE]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-110859738 Elizabeth HARRIGAN] on April 25, 1854 in Wollombi, New South Wales, Australia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1855 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945753 Robert John];
2 CONT * 1856 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945754 James Edward ];
2 CONT * 1858 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110854999 Alfred Albert ];
2 CONT * 1860 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945755 Riley George Underwood ];
2 CONT * 1862 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945757 Priscilla];
2 CONT * 1862 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110946871 Prosper ];
2 CONT * 1864 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945758 Joseph Henry ];
2 CONT * 1865 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110946916 Leslie James ];
2 CONT * 1866 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945760 William Willison ];
2 CONT * 1868 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945742 Matilda Jane];
2 CONT * 1870 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945743 Mary Louisa Beatrice];
2 CONT * 1872 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110946960 Amos Saul Winter ];
2 CONT * 1874 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945745 Frederick Ernest ];
2 CONT * 1876 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945749 Rosina Elizabeth ];
2 CONT * 1878 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945741 Daniel Prosper ];
2 CONT * 1879 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742996883 Robert Edward ];
2 CONT * 1882 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110945748 Emma Florence ]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on April 30, 1908 in Milton, New South Wales, Australia. 
2 CONT ----
