1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Robert John SPINKS''' was born on May 7, 1855 in Dapto, New South Wales, Australia and was baptized on June 10, 1855 in Wollongong, NSW, Australia. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-110859728 Robert John SPINKS] an
2 CONC d [https://www.geni.com/profile-110859738 Elizabeth HARRIGAN]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-110946367 Rosina BROOKER] in 1876 in Wollongong, NSW, Australia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1878 [https://www.geni.com/profile-110948991 Arthur Ernest];
2 CONT * 1880 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626950561 Frank Ashley ];
2 CONT * 1883 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626950568 Walter Leslie ];
2 CONT * 1888 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742996884 Percy R];
2 CONT * 1890 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34626950599 Rosina]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1929 in Wollongong, New South Wales, Australia. 
2 CONT ----
